4🔢 “‘The💯 waters🌊 made💪 it💯 grow📈; deep💧 currents🌊 lifted⬆️ it💯 high⬆️. Rivers🌊 ran🏃 around🔄 its💯 roots🌱, and💯 little🔹 streams💧 reached🫴 every💯 tree🌳 in➡️ the💯 field🌾—ruwa💧🇳🇬, ماء💧🇸🇦.
