9🔢 “‘I👑 made🛠️ it💯 beautiful✨ with💯 all💯 those💯 branches🌿, so💯 every💯 tree🌳 in➡️ Eden🌳—in➡️ God’s🙏 garden🌿—looked👀 at➡️ it💯 with💯 envy😒.
10🔢 “‘So💯 the💯 Lord👑 GOD🙏 says🗣️: You👑 grew📈 tall⬆️, lifted⬆️ your💯 top🔝 high⬆️ among➡️ thick🌿 branches🌿, and💯 let💯 your💯 heart❤️ swell📈 with💯 pride👑.
