14🔢 “‘This💯 happened💥 so💯 none💯 of➡️ the💯 other💯 trees🌳 by➡️ the💯 waters🌊 would⏳ get💭 proud👑 of➡️ their💯 height⬆️, shoot🌱 their💯 tops🔝 through➡️ the💯 thick🌿 branches🌿, or💯 stand⬆️ tall⬆️ in➡️ their💯 own💯 strength💪. All💯 who💯 drink💧 water🌊 are💯 headed➡️ for💯 death💀, down⬇️ to➡️ the💯 depths🌑 of➡️ the💯 earth🌍 with➡️ everyone👥 who💯 goes⬇️ to➡️ the💯 pit🕳️.
15🔢 “‘The💯 Lord👑 GOD🙏 says🗣️: When⏰ Assyria🏺 went⬇️ down⬇️ to➡️ the💯 grave⚰️, I👑 made💯 the💯 deep🌊 mourn😭. I👑 held🛑 back⬅️ its💯 floods🌊, and💯 the💯 waters🌊 went🛑 still🛑. I👑 made💯 Lebanon🌲 grieve😭 for➡️ it💯, and💯 the💯 trees🌳 of➡️ the💯 field🌾 drooped🥀 in➡️ sorrow😭.
