17🔢 “‘Its💯 allies🛡️ went⬇️ down⬇️ to➡️ the💯 pit🕳️ with💯 it💯, along➡️ with💯 those👥 killed⚔️ by➡️ the💯 sword⚔️—the💯 ones👥 who💪 had💯 been💯 its💯 strength💪 and💯 lived🏠 under➡️ its💯 shade🌳 among➡️ the💯 nations🌍.
18🔢 “‘Pharaoh👑, which💬 tree🌳 in➡️ Eden🌳 can💪 match⚖️ your💯 glory✨ and💯 greatness💪? Still💯, you👑 will⏳ be💯 brought⬇️ down⬇️ with💯 those💯 trees🌳 to➡️ the💯 depths🌑 of➡️ the💯 earth🌍. You👑 will⏳ lie🪦 among➡️ the💯 uncircumcised💀, with💯 those👥 killed⚔️ by➡️ the💯 sword⚔️. This💯 is💯 Pharaoh👑 and💯 all💯 his💯 people👥,’ says🗣️ the💯 Lord👑 GOD🙏.”